\subsection{Ablation Studies}
\label{sec:ablation}

\paragraph{Reward component ablation.}
Table~\ref{tab:ablation_components} presents a systematic ablation cascade. Each reward component contributes non-redundantly:

\begin{table}[t]
\centering
\small
